{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1240.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"f522a8ee7b9ab92f4885e8cf7c4fcbc7d52d670c3cf94547a5271db98c2bd064","ja":"穏やかな話し方","zh":"温和的说话方式","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1240.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"eaada558db50c0e1e32ae9d6fcc908432785c472672b896d7a7553337dd2bf05","ja":"子どもたちと仲良くなるための、他のコツ……？\nうーん、何かあるかしら……。","zh":"和小朋友们搞好关系的其他诀窍……？\n唔，会有什么呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1240.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"0724d428328582f75a20ccd666ed2d99e49b9471a3d56b388f1e8b58c497d3e9","ja":"難しく考えなくても、穏やかな気持ちで楽しく\n遊ぶことができれば、それでいいと思うわよ。","zh":"不用想得太复杂，只要能心平气和、开开心心地\n玩耍，我觉得那样就很好了哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1240.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"4baf334cdc9d84c76781506f3fe9093e2a4dda8e165b7526eae909117eb8d3be","ja":"穏やか……桜守さんの話し方も\nまさにそのような感じがいたしますね。","zh":"温和……樱守小姐说话的语气，\n确实也给人这种感觉呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1240.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6009a4f485a924045b796f82bb48ce11d5b132a33f3aad46eb6ecdf16efc229d","ja":"そうかしら？\nあんまり気にしたことはないけれど。","zh":"是吗？\n我倒是不怎么在意就是了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1240.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"90615be4aa2b93804bf322b5d0c76c45a564b85525219e550751ed79d5943940","ja":"はい、優しい先生そのものといった雰囲気で。\n私も参考にするといいのかもしれませんね……。","zh":"是的，氛围就像一位温柔的老师本人一样。\n或许我也该参考一下呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1240.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"a8046f3635ae020d4f9782ddd6dff79ca918bb56a14839392e2289a4d876a093","ja":"「みんな、こんにちは。\n今日は三味線を持ってきまし……きたの」","zh":"“大家好。\n今天我带来了三味线……嗯，带来了”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1240.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"99a8a784e5d43dbe3322882ad062fd2d283ebaccfd485ce65fdf44bf0e09479a","ja":"「三味線のこと、お姉さんがたくさん教えて\nあげ……るわね」……ど、どうでしょう？","zh":"“三味线的事情，大姐姐会好好教\n给……你的哦”……怎、怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1240.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"20ebb2cdf77721baed44a5fdc0d70b9d86771b5ae69e64ef4c2746cc0edf45bd","ja":"えーと……無理しなくてもいいんじゃないかしら？\nいつもの紬ちゃんの話し方で十分だって思うわよ。","zh":"那个……我觉得其实不用勉强自己呀？\n按平时小紬的说话方式就足够了哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1240.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"afc6551a9bb95bd006f3abf268236779cabecb696da796ece0eef74356025036","ja":"いえ、せっかくですから挑戦させてください。\n何度か練習していれば、上手にできるかもしれません。","zh":"不，难得有这个机会，请让我挑战一下吧。\n多练习几次的话，说不定就能做好了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1240.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"1dc4034bcdb0ef890f8a4b8b7b935942345354b5d3075520d0fb2308fb22c169","ja":"「お姉さんが弾いてみるから、よく聞いてください\nまし……くださいね」……えっと、もう一度……。","zh":"“大姐姐弹给你听，请你仔细听好\n哦……听好呢”……那个，再来一次……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1240.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81","ja":"ガチャッ","zh":"咔哒","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1240.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"f001fe31c98adf930dd43b65062ef85f4b7f3d9eeb0f64db8110eb5bfce94bcf","ja":"あっ、●●●●プロデューサーさん。\nお疲れさまです！","zh":"啊，●●●●制作人。\n辛苦了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1240.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"62c870b82e5624ff6421bcd15b162394bbe600441a434ba541448a619a99f97f","ja":"な、なぜこのタイミングにあなたが………まさか！\n私の練習をずっと聞いていたのですか！？","zh":"怎、怎么会偏偏在这种时候遇到你……难道说！\n你一直在听我练习吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1240.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"9f60ab07e8bbe0a0e70ba8a3eb4f56a4a8dfcb2be7aa241129f8e63895c86b73","ja":"そして私の口調を、陰でこそこそ\n笑っていた、と！？　なんと非情な……！","zh":"而且还在背后偷偷嘲笑\n我的说话腔调，是吗！？何其绝情……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
